### 2\. Protocol analysis functions

Zeek understands many network protocols.

| Protocol | Zeek's analysis                               |
| -------- | --------------------------------------------- |
| DNS      | Domain queries and DNS responses              |
| HTTP     | Requests, URLs, headers and responses         |
| TLS      | Certificates, versions and handshake metadata |
| TCP      | Connection establishment and termination      |
| UDP      | UDP communication                             |
| SSH      | SSH connection information                    |
| FTP      | File transfer activity                        |
| SMTP     | Email communication                           |
| DHCP     | IP address assignment                         |
| SMB      | Windows file-sharing activity                 |
| IRC      | Internet Relay Chat                           |
| Kerberos | Authentication protocol activity              |
| NTP      | Network time synchronization                  |
| MQTT     | IoT messaging                                 |
| QUIC     | Modern encrypted transport protocol           |
| SIP      | Voice communication signalling                |

Important: Zeek can identify and log information about encrypted communications, but it cannot automatically read encrypted application contents.

