### 8\. What Zeek cannot do by itself

It is important to understand its limitations.

| Zeek cannot automatically                      | Tool or approach to consider                           |
| ---------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |
| Exploit website vulnerabilities                | Burp Suite testing tools                               |
| Crack passwords                                | Dedicated password-auditing tools in authorized labs   |
| Decrypt arbitrary HTTPS traffic                | Authorized TLS decryption configuration                |
| Block every malicious connection               | Firewall or IPS                                        |
| Automatically discover every web vulnerability | Web vulnerability scanners and manual testing          |
| Intercept and modify browser requests          | Burp Suite Proxy                                       |
| Guarantee visibility into every device         | Correctly configured network monitoring infrastructure |

